            "type": "text",
            "title": "Scenario Timing Metrics",
            "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
            "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "## Scenario Timing Metrics\n\nScenario timing metrics will be populated when custom counters are added.\n\nExpected metrics (using `sentinel_*` prefix):\n- `sentinel_scenario_duration_seconds` — end-to-end scenario duration by scenario type\n- `sentinel_detection_latency_seconds` — time from mempool ingestion to detection\n- `sentinel_defense_response_latency_seconds` — time from detection to defense action\n- `sentinel_counterfactual_sim_duration_seconds` — simulation run duration\n\nThese metrics are emitted by the detection-engine and defense-agent services once custom prom-client counters/histograms are registered."
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "Services Reporting Metrics",
            "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
                    "expr": "count(up == 1)",
                    "refId": "A"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
                    "thresholds": {
                        "steps": [
                            { "color": "red", "value": null },
                            { "color": "yellow", "value": 3 },
                            { "color": "green", "value": 6 }
                        ]
                    }
                }
            },
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
                "orientation": "auto",
                "textMode": "auto",
                "colorMode": "background"
            }
        },
        {
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "sentinel_* metrics (placeholder — no data until custom counters added)",
            "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
            "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": { "type": "prometheus" },
                    "expr": "{__name__=~\"sentinel_.*\"}",
                    "legendFormat": "{{__name__}} {{job}}",
                    "refId": "A"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
                }
            },
            "options": { "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
        }
    ],
